    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωρο-δοκία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taking of bribes</i>, freq. in
