				And.
				4.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωροδοκίαν καταγνῶναί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					21.21
				</span></i>
			; -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίας κατηγορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.3
				</span></i>
			: pl., ibid.; also, <i>giving of bribes, corruption</i>, in
			pl., <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				39.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				50.7
			</span></i>.</div>
